      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LITTLE MISS MAY (1) hit the ground running last time with a fast early split and never headed, leading throughout to win by 3 lengths (22.87) over 400m at this track. Can continue the winning form. PAW REX (4) missed the frame last time but before that recorded the quickest win (21.92) on the program at Warrnambool in a Bottom Up - Grade 5. Can feature with the right run. CINDY CABANG (7) had a tricky draw and ran well to finish third, beaten 1.2 lengths, (19.67) at Healesville. Can measure up. ZIPPING GLINDA (2) hasn't been far away, finishing in the money twice in a row including last time in a Bottom Up - Grade 5 at Healesville over 300m.",
